## Licensing notice (strategic boundary)

Tiffany OS is adopting a **Private Core + Open Ecosystem** strategy. Components under
`tiffany_core/` and monetization/premium infrastructure are proprietary and may be
relocated to private repositories under a different license.

See `docs/open-ecosystem-strategy.md` and `tiffany_core/PRIVATE_CORE.md`.

Until repository split is complete, MIT applies to this monorepo as a transitional state
and does **not** represent a permanent licensing intent for all Tiffany OS components.
